          <div className="mb-8 overflow-hidden bg-black/40 p-4 border border-white/10 rounded-sm">
            <p className="text-white text-[10px] md:text-[11px] uppercase font-black tracking-normal leading-relaxed text-left">
              Good job, Meathead. Your quest to just fucking kill everyone in your way in your bloodlust from roid rage just happened to be known secretly by major counter terrorism units as "The Four Assholes." These guys were going to use their super powers to destroy the world through manipulation of natural disasters. Luckily for us, they happened to be in your way. You saved the world! Wanna try again?
            </p>
          </div>
          <button 
            disabled={isInputLocked}
            onClick={onStart} 
            className={`w-full py-6 text-black font-black border-b-[8px] text-xl shadow-xl transition-all ${isInputLocked ? 'bg-gray-700 border-gray-900 opacity-50 text-gray-500' : 'bg-yellow-400 hover:bg-yellow-300 border-yellow-700 active:translate-y-1 active:border-b-0'}`}
          >
