              Good job, Meathead. Your quest to just fucking kill everyone in your way in your bloodlust from roid rage just happened to be known secretly by major counter terrorism units as "The Four Assholes." These guys were going to use their super powers to destroy the world through manipulation of natural disasters. Luckily for us, they happened to be in your way. You saved the world! Wanna try again?
            </p>
