  SHOTGUN_DAMAGE, SHOTGUN_COOLDOWN, SHOTGUN_FREEZE_TIME, FLAMETHROWER_DAMAGE, FLAMETHROWER_RANGE, FLAMETHROWER_SPEED_MULT,
